### Scenario 1 — trial lifecycle

### 1. Subscribe (trial)
POST http://localhost:8080/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "trial": true}

###

### 2. Expire trial (success) → active
POST http://localhost:8080/expire-trial
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "success": true}

###

### 3. Low balance attempt 1
POST http://localhost:8080/charge-result
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "result": "low_balance"}

###

### 4. Low balance attempt 2
POST http://localhost:8080/charge-result
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "result": "low_balance"}

###

### 5. Low balance attempt 3 → suspended
POST http://localhost:8080/charge-result
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "result": "low_balance"}

###

### 6. Retry (success) → active
POST http://localhost:8080/retry
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "success": true}

###

### 7. Check state
GET http://localhost:8080/state/96478001

###

### 8. Unsubscribe → terminated + cooloff
POST http://localhost:8080/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily"}

###

### Scenario 2 — cooloff rejection

### 9. Subscribe during cooloff → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "service_id": "quiz-daily", "trial": false}

###

### Scenario 3 — paid → kick out

### 10. Subscribe paid → active
POST http://localhost:8080/subscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478002", "service_id": "sports-alerts", "trial": false}

###

### 11. Permanent failure → suspended
POST http://localhost:8080/charge-result
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478002", "service_id": "sports-alerts", "result": "permanent"}

###

### 12. Kick out → removed
POST http://localhost:8080/kick-out
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478002", "service_id": "sports-alerts"}

###

### 13. Check final state
GET http://localhost:8080/state/96478002

###

### Scenario 4 — stubs

### 14. send-mt stub
POST http://localhost:8080/send-mt
Content-Type: application/json

{"msisdn": "96478001", "message": "Welcome!"}

###

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/healthz

###

### Ready
GET http://localhost:8080/readyz
